## 6. 「待審核評量」— `pendingEvaluations`

```374:399:home/admin/frontend/src/pages/DirectorDashboard.vue
  // Pending evaluations via Laravel learning-records API (scoped to current branch). 待審核 = pending + 需修改 = changes_requested
  try {
    const lrParams = new URLSearchParams({ status: 'pending,changes_requested', per_page: '200' });
    if (props.branchId != null && props.branchId !== '') lrParams.set('branch_id', String(props.branchId));
    if (validCourseIds.size > 0) {
      lrParams.set('student_class_ids', Array.from(validCourseIds).join(','));
    }
    const lrUrl = `${baseUrl}/v1/learning-records?${lrParams}`;
    const lrResp = await fetch(lrUrl, {...});
    if (lrResp.ok) {
      const lrJson = await lrResp.json();
      const items = lrJson.data ?? lrJson;
      pendingEvaluations.value = Array.isArray(items) ? items : [];
    } else {
      pendingEvaluations.value = [];
    }
  } catch (e) {
    console.error('Failed to load pending evaluations:', e);
    pendingEvaluations.value = [];
  }
```

- 資料來源：後端 API `/v1/learning-records`。
- 參數：`status=pending,changes_requested`、`branch_id`、`student_class_ids`。

模板在第 114–131 行：

```114:131:home/admin/frontend/src/pages/DirectorDashboard.vue
          <div v-for="evalItem in pendingEvaluations" :key="evalItem.id" class="review-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <strong>{{ evalItem.student_name }}</strong>
              <span class="tag">{{ evalItem.Subject || evalItem.student_class_label }}</span>
              ...
            </div>
            ...
          </div>
```

---

## 7. 今日排課來源：`schedules` 還是 `student-classes`？

- **實際顯示的資料來源**：Supabase `schedules` 表。
- **排課內容的產生**：由 `ensureSchedulesFromStudentClasses` 根據 `student-classes` 的設定（週幾、時段、開始/結束日期）算出需要的日期，再插入到 `schedules` 表。
- **流程總結**：`student-classes` 定義有哪些課；`ensureSchedulesFromStudentClasses` 把缺少的排課寫進 `schedules`；`loadData` 從 `schedules` 查 `schedule_date === today` 作為今日排課。
